## Proposed Technical Changes

### 1. Petrophysical Imputation & Benchmarking Engine
#### [NEW] [imputation-engine.ts](file:///c:/Users/Ekwebelam%20C%20Williams/Desktop/WellQC+/src/lib/las/imputation-engine.ts)
- Implement petrophysical missing value cause diagnostic (`detectMissingValueOrigins`).
- Implement LAS null representation parser and normalizer.
- Implement multi-method imputation algorithms:
  - **Linear Interpolation** (Baseline continuous depth interpolation)
  - **KNN Imputation** (K-Nearest Neighbours using multi-curve spatial/petrophysical feature distance)
  - **Statistical Imputer** (Mean & Median central tendency strategy)
  - **Cubic Spline Interpolation** (Smooth curve fitting)
  - **Row Dropping / Listwise Deletion** (Threshold-based row removal)
- Implement empirical cross-validation benchmarking (`benchmarkImputationMethods`) returning RMSE, MAE, R², variance ratio, and execution time.

#### [MODIFY] [quality-engine.ts](file:///c:/Users/Ekwebelam%20C%20Williams/Desktop/WellQC+/src/lib/las/quality-engine.ts)
